you need to add your proxy lines to apt.conf in this direcotry:
	/etc/apt/apt.conf
create that if there is no apt.conf 
	sudo nano /etc/apt/apt.conf

add these
	Acquire::http::Proxy "http://USERNAME:PASSWORD@SERVER:PORT";
	Acquire::https::Proxy "https://USERNAME:PASSWORD@SERVER:PORT";
	Acquire:HTTP::PROXY "http://USERNAME:PASSWORD@SERVER:PORT";
	Acquire::HTTPS::PROXY "https://USERNAME:PASSWORD@SERVER:PORT";
where in double qoutations there is url of your own proxy and port.
